{"id":417,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"6年後を見据えた中高一貫の学び","feature_description":"洛南高等学校附属中学校は、中高一貫教育の特性を生かし、6年後を見据えた授業を行います。英語は中学1年から週6時間で、外国人講師による授業も取り入れます。中学2年で中学課程を終えた後は発展学習へ進み、数学では予習習慣と考える力、表現力を重視。独自教材や小テストを用いながら、学習内容を繰り返し定着させます。国語の小テストや、自然への姿勢と科学の方法を培う理科教育にも取り組みます。","clubs":[{"id":8261,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8262,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8263,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8264,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8265,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8266,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8267,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8268,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8269,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-sports/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8281,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-culture/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8282,"name":"俳句創作部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.rakunan-h.ed.jp/club/clubcategory/junior-culture/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8283,"name":"競技かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url